cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: mlock
abstract: >-
  A MATLAB package that resolves a project's dependencies (required files and
  MathWorks products) into a verifiable SHA-256 lockfile, with tooling to verify
  file integrity and check that an environment can satisfy the lock.
type: software
